- description:  Subroutine generate_sfc_xgrid updates fractional areas on the surface exchange grid and recompute the number of active exchange-grid cells. The fractional area measures the portion of each exchange-grid cell that corresponds to land or ice. fms_xgrid_set_frac_area is called for both the OCN (ice) and LND (land) grids to reflect the current sea-ice concentration and land-tile coverage.
