text: - description:  Function calc_kw calculates the total transfer velocities from the "point of view" of liquid following Johnson Implementation from Johnson, Ocean Science, 2010. (http://doi.org/10.5194/os-6-913-2010) Uses equations defined in Liss[1974], F = K_g(c_g - H C_l) = K_l(c_g/H - C_l) where, F is the flux of gas across air-water interface, c_g and C_l are the bulk gas and liquid concentrations, H is the Henry's law constant (H = c_{sg}/C_{sl}), C_{sg} is the equilibrium concentration in
ntokens:    308
id: 468826977552564690
