ichunk: 1
chunks: [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]
text: `Atm%Surf_diff` is of type `surf_diff_type`, defined in `atmos_phys/atmos_param/vert_diff/vert_diff.F90`. It carries the forward-elimination coefficients from the implicit vertical diffusion scheme that couples the atmosphere to the surface models.  
| Field | Type / Dimensions | Units | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
ntokens:    402
id: 468826977552565143
