chunks: [1]
text: `ice_ocean_driver_type` is the control structure for the combined ice-ocean driver module (`combined_ice_ocean_driver`). It is used only when `combine_ice_and_ocean`, along with `concurrent_ice` and `slow_ice_with_ocean`, are true in `coupler_nml`.  
